{"id":"CVE-2016-1247","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"debian","published":"2016-11-29T17:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-05T22:48:13.613Z","description":"The nginx package before 1.6.2-5+deb8u3 on Debian jessie, the nginx packages before 1.4.6-1ubuntu3.6 on Ubuntu 14.04 LTS, before 1.10.0-0ubuntu0.16.04.3 on Ubuntu 16.04 LTS, and before 1.10.1-0ubuntu1.1 on Ubuntu 16.10, and the nginx ebuild before 1.10.2-r3 on Gentoo allow local users with access to the web server user account to gain root privileges via a symlink attack on the error log.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40768/","tags":["exploit","x_refsource_EXPLOIT-DB"],"name":"40768"},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/539796/100/0/threaded","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_BUGTRAQ"],"name":"20161121 Nginx (Debian-based distros) - Root Privilege Escalation (CVE-2016-1247)"},{"url":"http://www.debian.org/security/2016/dsa-3701","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_DEBIAN"],"name":"DSA-3701"},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aTswN1k1fQs","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93903","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"93903"},{"url":"https://legalhackers.com/advisories/Nginx-Exploit-Deb-Root-PrivEsc-CVE-2016-1247.html","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-3114-1","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-3114-1"},{"url":"http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2017/Jan/33","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_FULLDISC"],"name":"20170113 Nginx (Debian-based + Gentoo distros) - Root Privilege Escalation [CVE-2016-1247 UPDATE]"},{"url":"https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201701-22","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_GENTOO"],"name":"GLSA-201701-22"},{"url":"http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1037104","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_SECTRACK"],"name":"1037104"},{"url":"http://seclists.o